# Dependencies & build output (rebuilt inside the image)
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/out

# Local env & databases (never bake secrets or local data into the image)
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.db
**/*.db-journal

# Dev & test artifacts
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/coverage
**/.playwright

# VCS & tooling
.git
.gitignore
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log
Dockerfile
docker-compose.yml
.dockerignore
